/T (Engineered an end-to-end churn analytics pipeline for an OTT subscription dataset \(20+ KPIs\), identifying a 28.6% overall churn rate and surfacing that monthly-contract subscribers churned at 55.6%, which is 6.7 times the 8.3% annual-contract rate- directly attributing $73.94/mo in MRR leakage and $2,047 in CLTV erosion to six at-risk customers, enabling a targeted contract-migration retention strategy.)
